<title>UK: BP sets July LPG price at $164/$158 a tonne.</title>
<headline>BP sets July LPG price at $164/$158 a tonne.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum has announced its July price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas (LPG), the BP Agreed Price or BPAP.</p>
<p>The propane price will be $164 a tonne, a fall of $9 a tonne from the June level. And butane will be $158 a tonne, down $1 a tonne from June.</p>
<p>The price is effective from July 1.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
